# GitHub Linguist Language Overrides
# Treat HTML visualizers, dashboards, and documentation assets as vendored / non-detectable
# so repository language statistics accurately reflect 100% Python robotics core.
docs/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-vendored
*.html -linguist-detectable
*.html linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-documentation
*.htm -linguist-detectable
*.htm linguist-vendored
*.htm linguist-documentation
